The Shaykh (Al-Mufid), may Allah {SWT} support him, informed me from Abu al-Qasim Jaʿfar ibn Muhammad,
from Muhammad ibn Yaʿqub, from Ali ibn Ibrahim, from his father, from Ibn Abi ʿUmayr, from Ibn Udhaynah,
from al-Ahwal, who said:
I said to Abu Abdullah {a.s}: "I come out of the restroom and cleanse myself with water,
but my clothing touches the water that I used for Istinjaʾ. Is there any harm in this?"
Imam {a.s} replied: "There is no harm in it."

