from his father, from ‘Umar ibn Hanzalah, from Abu Abdillah {a.s}, who said:
(Imam {a.s} said) “When the sun passes the meridian, the time for Dhuhr has entered,
except that there is a supererogatory prayer before it, and that is up to you, if you wish,
you may lengthen it, and if you wish, you may shorten it.”

