Muhammad ibn Ya‘qub, from Muhammad ibn Yahya, from Ahmad ibn al-Hasan ibn Ali, from Amr ibn Sa‘id,
from Musaddiq ibn Sadaqah, from ‘Ammar al-Sabati:
Abu Abdillah {a.s} said: "Do not pray in a house in which there is wine or an intoxicant."

text_chunk:
