Muhammad ibn Ali ibn Mahbub from Muhammad ibn Al-Husayn from Muhammad ibn Hammad ibn Zayd
from Abdullah ibn Yahya Al-Kahili who said:
Abu Abdillah {a.s}, peace be upon him, led us in prayer at the mosque of Banu Kahil, and
Imam {a.s} recited aloud twice "Bismillah Hir Rahman Nir Rahim", and Imam {a.s}
performed the Qunoot in the Fajr prayer, and Imam {a.s} gave one salutation (salam)
toward the Qiblah side.

