text_en:
From him, from Muhammad ibn Abi Hamzah, from Abdullah ibn Sinan, from Abu Abdillah {a.s}, peace be upon
him:
A man asked Imam {a.s}, saying: "I prayed ‘Asr on top of Abu Qubays (Mount which
overlooks the Kaʿbah), does that suffice, while the Ka‘bah was lower (than) me?"
Imam {a.s} said: "Yes. Indeed, it is a qiblah from its location up to the sky."
